Cell["\<\
On the sphere the tiling is finite, and from the diameter of the solid on the \
ball is the whole Platonic solid. In the plane the ball grows quadratically, \
in the hyperbolic plane exponentially.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"572d6e35-0cc6-4cd7-bd39-a62eaa94f74f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The ball has a rim, where a vertex has fewer than ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 " neighbours, and it does not wrap round as the closed maps of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["TessellationGraph"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/TessellationGraph", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "581dd5f0-a1ad-424b-b8ae-96036c063adc"],
 " do. The tilings of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraSubstrate"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraSubstrate", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "6ad1b5df-7f54-4d54-a1a2-82a57e094688"],
 " are such balls with the contour removed by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["BoundarylessGraph"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/BoundarylessGraph", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "14880231-95b9-4870-9f44-050e332f1ff5"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"472365c8-3120-429f-90e4-6bc145e2ddf9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The Euclidean configurations {3, 6, 3, 6}, {3, 4, 6, 4}, {4, 6, 12}, {4, 8, \
8}, {3, 12, 12} and the hyperbolic ones are built; a spherical one gives a \
ball of the Archimedean solid. Snub and elongated tilings are not built. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Graph"]], "paclet:ref/Graph"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "193902b4-7dd6-480e-b3b1-fb021633ced9"],
 " options are passed on."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"8b77f18d-3207-4fee-8d72-ea5a56eadd91"]
}, Open  ]],

