Cell["\<\
The ball of radius 3 in the tilings by triangles, five, six and seven at \
every vertex. On the sphere it is the whole icosahedron:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"c4598dc4-6a44-4b83-a350-32a3bba6e80d"],

